# One rung of tools/check_illusion_flags.sh (bd inc-pu6v.43): cast one illusion
# spell, try to pick up the illusory item, photograph what the game says.
# One spell per session because a cast starts concentration (inc-59lq), which
# refuses every later cast. The oracle and the spell ladder are described in
# tools/check_illusion_flags.sh.
#
# SPACE, NEVER ESC, to clear the "-- more --" prompt. In play mode ESC opens
# the System Menu, whose [a] is Save and Quit; a stray ESC ends the run and
# still exits 0.

@dump:arrival

@until "Select Spell" m
@choose "Improved Spectral"
i
@expect "Target Illusion"
ENTER
SPACE
g
@dump:il-d-spectral-improved
